re_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/a3a59d3a536b2643ed9ac21a87b93ab9.poster.avif?t=1729624314\" width=620 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/a3a59d3a536b2643ed9ac21a87b93ab9.webm?t=1729624314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/1311220dd3e7dac3d01526d4e9852815.webp?t=1729624314\" width=620 height=60 /></span><br>Live a tale not told through words but through an immersive adventure, enriched by a stunning 4K black and white artistic style, 2D living scenery, evocative paintings, and powerful atmospheric music. Influenced by 80's black and white indie comics and 90\u2019s mangas, as well as the Franco-Belgian comics of the 70\u2019s, the monochrome imagery is also symbolic, representing the duality of light and darkness. This is a story whose artistic style invites you to explore and reflect.<br><br>",
